						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b2e3f38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-gimont_elementor_heading" data-id="b2e3f38" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="gimont_elementor_heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					
			<div class="ova-heading template_1">
															<span class="line"></span>
										<span class="subtitle">The Convener</span>
													
															<h2 class="title">Message From The Convener</h2>
										
								
									<p class="desc">It is with great pleasure that I welcome you to the Boardroom Governance Summit — a platform created to foster critical dialogue, share insights, and strengthen corporate governance practices across Africa.

As we navigate an era marked by disruption, innovation, and growing stakeholder expectations, it is imperative that boardrooms evolve — not just to meet compliance standards, but to lead with integrity, foresight, and impact. This summit is designed to bring together seasoned leaders, emerging thinkers, regulators, and professionals committed to raising the bar of accountability and strategic leadership.

Thank you for being part of this movement. I look forward to the connections, conversations, and commitments that will shape better boardrooms and, ultimately, better organizations.</p>
				
			</div>

