		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c275ca2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c275ca2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1fd9f74 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="1fd9f74" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default">
							<div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys">
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-3330" class="e-n-accordion-item" open>
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-3330" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Before I commit, can you just tell me plainly what this summit is? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3330" class="elementor-element elementor-element-0a6b580 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0a6b580" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3330" class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ff7e6f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="4ff7e6f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3330" class="elementor-element elementor-element-3fd0ffe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3fd0ffe" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-75a0b0f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="75a0b0f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
							<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3330" class="elementor-element elementor-element-3820a46 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3820a46" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4542558 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4542558" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>The Boardroom Governance Summit is Africa&#8217;s pioneering boardroom-focused event, and the largest gathering of its kind in Ghana. Once a year, we bring together more than 1,000 board chairpersons, directors, chief executives, C-suite leaders, regulators, and policymakers at the Labadi Beach Hotel in Accra, to confront the real issues shaping modern boardrooms. Not the polished, theoretical version you find in textbooks and training slides, but how governance actually plays out under pressure.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-3331" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="2" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-3331" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> What is this year's theme, and why should it matter to me personally? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3331" class="elementor-element elementor-element-60fd441 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="60fd441" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3331" class="elementor-element elementor-element-d23e843 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="d23e843" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3331" class="elementor-element elementor-element-851c7dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="851c7dc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9d1e17d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="9d1e17d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
							<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3331" class="elementor-element elementor-element-f88745c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f88745c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-648989f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="648989f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>The theme is Committees of the Board, From Oversight to Impact. Most boards treat committees as a compliance formality, a box ticked between meetings. We are challenging that directly. Can your Audit Committee, your ESG Committee, your Finance Committee actually move the needle on organisational performance, or are they simply producing minutes nobody reads? If you carry board responsibility, or hope to one day, this is not optional listening.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-3332" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="3" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-3332" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Walk me through the actual programme for the day. </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3332" class="elementor-element elementor-element-517dc6c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="517dc6c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3332" class="elementor-element elementor-element-152d96e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="152d96e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3332" class="elementor-element elementor-element-5b0211c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5b0211c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0d7cb9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="e0d7cb9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
							<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
		<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-3332" class="elementor-element elementor-element-6206129 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6206129" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2f32bbf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2f32bbf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>We open with a keynote from a prominent national or industry leader. Past keynote speakers have included the current Chief of Staff at the Office of the President of Ghana, the previous Minister for Finance, and the Chief Executive Officer of the State Interests and Governance Authority. This year&#8217;s keynote speaker is even more distinguished, and will be officially unveiled soon. From there, we move into three major panel discussions, each designed to challenge conventional boardroom thinking rather than simply confirm it.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
